cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Tenebrio_Metaproteome: analysis code for the metaproteomic
  study of a Tenebrio molitor gut-derived bacterial consortium
  grown on polyethylene
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and
  the associated publication.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alfonso
    family-names: Olaya-Abril
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8961-1099'
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology,
      Universidad de Córdoba, Spain
    email: b22olaba@uco.es
repository-code: 'https://github.com/AlfonsoOA/Tenebrio_Metaproteome'
abstract: >-
  R and shell code implementing the quantitative metaproteomic
  analysis and the functional annotation workflow reported in the
  associated publication, covering quality control, normalisation,
  missing-value handling, differential abundance analysis,
  co-expression analysis, functional enrichment and annotation with
  EggNOG-mapper and InterProScan.
keywords:
  - metaproteomics
  - proteomics
  - plastic biodegradation
  - polyethylene
  - Tenebrio molitor
  - microbial consortium
  - functional annotation
license: MIT
